      },
      "message": "fix(motion): lathe Facing faces the stock's allowance above a finished part\n\nturning::facing now takes the setup's stock beside the part: the axis\nis still fitted to the part, but the ladder climbs to the stock's end\nand the bands and rapids radius read the stock too. A bar's facing\nallowance declared in the stock is faced to the part's end instead of\n\"nothing to face\"; with neither stock nor part above the plane the\nrefusal names both.\n\nFixes #122\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
