      "message": "test(app): facing golden starts outside the raw bar; the work-offset law moves the stock too\n\nThe lathe facing golden's passes now start at diameter 13.6 (the r6\nbar stock + the 0.8 nose) instead of 11.6 (the r5 neck + nose, inside\nthe raw bar); every other line is unchanged. The spindle law's\n\"moved work offset posts the same program\" fixture moves its box stock\nwith the bar and G54, since facing now reads the stock.\n\nRefs #122\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
